database/database
# DictionaryTrainer's default StoragePath ("./compression/dictionaries")
# is relative and not test-isolated (DeltaEncodingConfig has no way to
# override it — NewDeltaEncoder always calls
# DefaultDictionaryTrainingConfig()); go test's CWD-per-package resolves
# this under backend/core/network/dwcp/compression/, and any test that
# successfully trains a dictionary persists real .dict.json files there.
# See novacron-hpa notes for the tracked follow-up.
backend/core/network/dwcp/compression/compression/
backend/core/network/dwcp/**/dictionaries/*.dict.json
